
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional - Story Options.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional - Story Options.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"94dfna","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1776993454766,"size":2388,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"94dfna"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,13],"#Optional - Story Options":[15,16],"#After the main text or </Status>, the options **must** be immediately enclosed in <options> </options>. Use English only.":[17,38],"#After the main text or </Status>, the options **must** be immediately enclosed in <options> </options>. Use English only.#{1}":[18,22],"#After the main text or </Status>, the options **must** be immediately enclosed in <options> </options>. Use English only.#{2}":[23,23],"#After the main text or </Status>, the options **must** be immediately enclosed in <options> </options>. Use English only.#{3}":[24,24],"#After the main text or </Status>, the options **must** be immediately enclosed in <options> </options>. Use English only.#{4}":[25,25],"#After the main text or </Status>, the options **must** be immediately enclosed in <options> </options>. Use English only.#{5}":[26,26],"#After the main text or </Status>, the options **must** be immediately enclosed in <options> </options>. Use English only.#{6}":[27,27],"#After the main text or </Status>, the options **must** be immediately enclosed in <options> </options>. Use English only.#{7}":[28,28],"#After the main text or </Status>, the options **must** be immediately enclosed in <options> </options>. Use English only.#{8}":[29,29],"#After the main text or </Status>, the options **must** be immediately enclosed in <options> </options>. Use English only.#{9}":[30,30],"#After the main text or </Status>, the options **must** be immediately enclosed in <options> </options>. Use English only.#{10}":[31,31],"#After the main text or </Status>, the options **must** be immediately enclosed in <options> </options>. Use English only.#{11}":[32,38]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":120,"tags":["#lorebook","#lorebook-always"],"position":"in_chat","depth":1,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**What this is:** This entry defines the required format and rules for presenting story-choice options to the user. It mandates a strict <options> tag block containing exactly 9 numbered options, each with a distinct tone (normal, evil, erotic, etc.) and a maximum of 30 words. Options must be story directions, not specific actions/dialogue, and cannot reveal information unknown to {{user}}.\n\n**When to select:** Select this entry whenever generating interactive story text, specifically after the main text or <Status> section, to present the player with narrative branching choices.\n\n**Key relationships:** Links to: (1) narrative generation — this controls user interaction; (2) status/progression — options appear after main text; (3) tone/alignment — each option must have a unique category. Directly contradicts: free-form narrative without choices, or any option count other than 9."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional - Story Options.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1pbft4f","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional - Story Options.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,13],"size":1034,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
